{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1724;--card:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--glass:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));--accent:#8bd3c7;--muted:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);--glass-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}    
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#e6eef0;background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(139,211,199,0.06), transparent), radial-gradient(800px 400px at 90% 90%, rgba(140,190,240,0.03), transparent), var(--bg);}
    header{position:sticky;top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 28px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px) saturate(120%);}
    .nav-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .brand{font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:48px auto;padding:28px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:24px;align-items:center}
    .panel{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);padding:26px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:26px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6fbfb5);color:#042026;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .trust{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .testimonial{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02);font-size:14px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:18px}
    .benefit{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .process{margin-top:18px}
    .step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .step:first-child{border-top:0}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .accordion{margin-top:18px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
    .acc-item{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .acc-body{padding:12px 14px;background:#061018;color:var(--muted);display:none}
    footer{margin-top:28px;padding:18px 14px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.2);border-radius:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .danger{color:#ffd8d2;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,60,60,0.04), transparent);padding:10px;border-radius:8px}
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.panel{padding:18px}.trust{flex-direction:row;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav-card">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <div class="small" style="margin-left:8px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Why Work Together</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="panel">
        <h1>About the practice</h1>
        <p class="lead">I offer focused, time-limited therapeutic intensives designed for people navigating a particular knot of experience. We map a clear intention, attend to the felt body and narrative, and leave with practical, gentle skills that can be carried forward.</p>
        <div class="meta">Clinical therapist serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Telehealth and limited in-person slots • Sessions scheduled by appointment</div>

        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>

        <div class="process">
          <div class="step"><div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);min-width:36px">1</div><div><div style="font-weight:600">Intake & focus</div><div class="small">We clarify what matters now and set a short, achievable goal for the intensive.</div></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);min-width:36px">2</div><div><div style="font-weight:600">In-session work</div><div class="small">A concentrated therapeutic hour or series using somatic, relational, and cognitive approaches tailored to your needs.</div></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);min-width:36px">3</div><div><div style="font-weight:600">Integration plan</div><div class="small">Short, pragmatic strategies to practice between sessions so insights translate into daily life.</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel trust">
        <div style="font-weight:700">Client reflections</div>
        <div class="testimonial">"A single intensive helped me clarify the next month instead of feeling muddled for a year." — K.</div>
        <div class="testimonial">"Calm, clear, and practical — I left with a plan I could actually use." — S.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Insurance: Not accepted. Sliding scale available for select slots. Contact for details: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" style="margin-top:22px">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">What I offer</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Single-session clarity</strong><div class="small">60–90 minute focused session to unstick a specific problem or decision.</div></div>
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Focused intensives</strong><div class="small">One- to three-session intensives that pair assessment with direct practice and a short integration plan.</div></div>
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Short-term consultation</strong><div class="small">A small bundle of check-ins after an intensive to support skill integration.</div></div>
        <div class="benefit"><strong>Referrals & coordination</strong><div class="small">If your needs are outside my scope I will offer appropriate referrals and coordinate care respectfully.</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">My approach</h2>
      <p class="small">I combine attention to bodily experience, relational patterns, and practical behavior change. Sessions are collaborative; you remain the author of your experience. I aim to offer a gentle structure and clear practices rather than prolonged interpretation.</p>

      <div class="accordion" id="confidentiality-accordion">
        <div class="acc-item" data-target="b1">Session boundaries & confidentiality <span class="small">+</span></div>
        <div class="acc-body" id="b1">Conversations are confidential within legal and ethical limits. I will explain limits to confidentiality, record-keeping, and how I handle requests for records during intake. If coordination with other professionals is helpful, we will discuss consent explicitly.</div>

        <div class="acc-item" data-target="b2">Scope & referrals <span class="small">+</span></div>
        <div class="acc-body" id="b2">I work with adults on mood, transitions, relationship concerns, and stress. If you need medication management, emergency psychiatric care, or specialized services for complex trauma beyond short-term intensives, I will help connect you with appropriate clinicians.</div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:12px" class="small">If you are in crisis and there is immediate risk of harm to yourself or others, call your local emergency number or community crisis line. If you are in the United States, you can call or text 988 for the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. If you are outside the U.S., please use your local emergency resources.</div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div style="font-weight:700">Professional note</div>
      <div class="small">I hold a current clinical license and adhere to professional standards. Nothing here is a guarantee of outcome. Sessions do not replace emergency services.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px" class="danger">Confidentiality reminder: If you disclose imminent intent to harm yourself or others or there is suspected abuse of a minor, I am legally obligated to act to protect safety.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;text-align:right"><a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Simple accordion for confidentiality
    document.querySelectorAll('.acc-item').forEach(function(item){
      item.addEventListener('click', function(){
        var target = document.getElementById(this.dataset.target);
        var showing = target.style.display === 'block';
        document.querySelectorAll('.acc-body').forEach(function(b){b.style.display='none'});
        if(!showing) target.style.display='block';
      })
    })
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"specialties.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Offerings — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#09121a;--card:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--accent:#b2f0e0;--muted:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);--glass-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06)}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Roboto,Arial;color:#e9fbf8;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071419 0%, #081622 100%);}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 26px;background:transparent}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:12px}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:20px}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);padding:20px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;gap:18px}
    .left{flex:1}
    h1{margin:0;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted)}
    .selector{margin-top:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .mood-list{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted)}
    .mood.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#7fe6d4);color:#042026;font-weight:700}
    .method-card{margin-top:16px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .methods{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
    .method{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#022429;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    @media (max-width:820px){.methods{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Why Work Together</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="left">
        <h1>Therapeutic offerings</h1>
        <p class="lead">Choose the starting place that matches how you feel right now. The "Mood-to-Method" selector will propose a focused offering and tailor the call-to-action to that approach. No pressure — explore the language and find what lands for you.</p>

        <div class="selector" id="mood-selector">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">How are you right now?</div>
          <div class="mood-list">
            <button class="mood" data-key="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="stuck">Stuck / Indecisive</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="transition">Transitioning</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="relationship">Relational friction</button>
            <button class="mood" data-key="grief">Grief & loss</button>
          </div>

          <div class="method-card" id="method-card">
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700">Recommended approach</div>
            <div id="method-title" style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Choose a mood above to see a recommended offering.</div>
            <div id="method-desc" class="note"></div>
            <a id="primary-cta" class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <div class="note">If you prefer a different format (brief consult, multi-session), mention it in your booking note.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside style="width:320px">
        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Offer types (examples)</div>
          <div class="methods">
            <div class="method"><strong>Compass Session</strong><div class="note">60–75 min single session to orient and make a one-month plan.</div></div>
            <div class="method"><strong>Focused Intensive</strong><div class="note">One or two sessions with deeper practice and a short integration plan.</div></div>
            <div class="method"><strong>Pulse Check-ins</strong><div class="note">3-session bundle over 4–6 weeks to consolidate skills.</div></div>
            <div class="method"><strong>Relational Recalibration</strong><div class="note">Short series oriented to communication and boundary practice.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Accessibility</div>
          <div class="note">Limited sliding scale. Telehealth sessions are offered across many states—reach out to confirm availability in {{STATE}}.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Specialties</h2>
      <ul style="color:var(--muted)">
        <li>Life transitions (career shifts, separation, relocation) — short intensives and integration planning</li>
        <li>Decision paralysis and chronic worry — targeted clarity sessions</li>
        <li>Relationship patterns and communication — recalibration-focused work</li>
        <li>Stress, burnout, and pacing — body-aware strategies for daily regulation</li>
        <li>Loss, grief, and complex change — companioning through difficult transitions</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)">
        <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">A short note on scope</div>
        <div class="note">I do not provide forensic evaluations, medication management, or emergency services. If your needs fall outside these offerings, I will help you find a clinician whose work is a closer match.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">
      <div style="font-weight:700">Crisis notice</div>
      <div>If you are in immediate danger or are experiencing a psychiatric emergency, please call your local emergency number. In the U.S., dial or text 988 for the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. For other countries, contact local emergency services.</div>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method mapping
    const map = {
      overwhelmed: {
        title: 'Compass Session — 60–75 min',
        desc: 'A focused session to help sort immediate priorities and create a small, doable plan to reduce overwhelm.',
        ctaSuffix: 'Request Compass Session'
      },
      stuck: {
        title:'Decision Mapping Intensive — Single deep session',
        desc:'Work through a pivotal choice with structured exploration and a practical next-step framework.',
        ctaSuffix:'Request Decision Mapping'
      },
      transition: {
        title:'Transition Intensive — 2 sessions',
        desc:'Short series to help you orient to change, practice new habits, and settle an action plan for the next 4–8 weeks.',
        ctaSuffix:'Request Transition Intensive'
      },
      relationship: {
        title:'Relational Recalibration — 3 sessions',
        desc:'Session bundle focused on communication shifts, boundary work, and rehearsal of new responses.',
        ctaSuffix:'Request Relational Recalibration'
      },
      grief: {
        title:'Companion Session — 60 min',
        desc:'An attuned space to hold loss, map resources, and plan supportive practices for the days ahead.',
        ctaSuffix:'Request Companion Session'
      }
    };

    const buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
    const titleEl = document.getElementById('method-title');
    const descEl = document.getElementById('method-desc');
    const cta = document.getElementById('primary-cta');

    buttons.forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
      buttons.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
      this.classList.add('active');
      const key = this.dataset.key;
      const item = map[key];
      titleEl.textContent = item.title;
      descEl.textContent = item.desc;
      // Update CTA text while preserving the booking URL placeholder
      cta.textContent = item.ctaSuffix + ' — ' + '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
      // Add a query param to indicate the selected approach for the booking flow
      cta.href = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' + '?approach=' + encodeURIComponent(item.title);
    }));
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#071018;--card:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--accent:#aeeadb;--muted:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);--glass-border:rgba(255,255,255,0.05)}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Roboto,Arial;color:#e8fbf6;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#051115 0%, #072022 100%)}
    header{padding:18px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:12px}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:18px}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--glass-border)}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0}
    .manifest{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .flow{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:12px}
    .card{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .timeline{margin-top:12px}
    .timeline .item{padding:10px;border-left:3px solid rgba(174,234,219,0.12);margin-bottom:10px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#032425;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .accordion{margin-top:16px}
    .acc-item{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:8px}
    .acc-body{display:none;padding:10px;border-left:3px solid rgba(174,234,219,0.12);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.2);color:var(--muted);border-radius:6px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    @media (max-width:820px){.flow{flex-direction:column}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Why Work Together</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="panel">
      <h1>How I work with short intensives</h1>
      <p class="manifest">My practice is organized around focused offerings that respect a clear time boundary. This helps keep therapy practical and oriented toward immediate change while holding space for reflection.</p>

      <div class="flow">
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Intake</div>
          <div class="small">A brief intake conversation to make sure the intensive is the right fit, clarify goals, and cover consent and confidentiality details.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Work phase</div>
          <div class="small">One or a small set of focused sessions using somatic, narrative, and skills-based interventions chosen for your situation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Integration</div>
          <div class="small">A short plan of practices and supports. Optional follow-up checks are available as a short bundle if helpful.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="item"><strong>Assessment</strong> — we clarify the felt problem and your practical aims.</div>
        <div class="item"><strong>Intervention</strong> — targeted in-session work, practice, and immediate experiments.</div>
        <div class="item"><strong>Consolidation</strong> — a written integration plan with steps for the coming weeks.</div>
      </div>

      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" style="margin-top:16px">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Therapeutic stance</h2>
      <p class="small">I position myself as a collaborative guide: I offer observations, experiments, and practices, while you choose what feels right and sustainable. I attend to both feeling and function — how you feel inside and what you want to do outside.</p>

      <div class="accordion" id="bounds-accordion">
        <div class="acc-item" data-target="s1">Session boundaries & confidentiality</div>
        <div class="acc-body" id="s1">Sessions are private and generally confidential. I keep brief clinical notes for continuity of care. Exceptions to confidentiality (such as imminent risk of harm, suspected abuse, or court-ordered disclosures) will be reviewed during intake.</div>

        <div class="acc-item" data-target="s2">Cancellation & session policy</div>
        <div class="acc-body" id="s2">I ask for at least 48 hours notice for cancellations of intensives when possible. Fees for late cancellations are discussed at intake. Courteous communication supports a respectful therapeutic arrangement.</div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:12px" class="small">If you are currently in crisis or feel unsafe, please call your local emergency number right away. In the United States, you can call or text 988 for immediate crisis support.</div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:16px" class="panel">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Practice ethics and referrals</h2>
      <p class="small">I adhere to professional ethical standards. If an extended course of care, medication evaluation, or specialized trauma work is a better match, I will provide referrals and help coordinate with other clinicians when requested.</p>

      <div style="margin-top:10px">
        <div style="font-weight:700">Coordination with other professionals</div>
        <div class="small">With your written consent, I can share brief summaries or consult with other professionals involved in your care to ensure alignment and safety.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div style="font-weight:700">Careful language</div>
